  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Kentegra Pyrethrum Refined Extract Capacity Expansion Feasibility Study, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to Kentegra Biotechnology (EPZ) Limited is funding a feasibility study (Study) that would support the development of a full-scale pyrethrum refined extract facility in Nakuru County, Kenya. The opportunity to execute the Study would be competed among U.S. firms on the USTDA website and publicized via www.sam.gov, as well as highlighted through USTDA and Prosper Africa social media and marketing platforms.</narrative>
  </description>
